A final grade, once submitted to the Registrar's Office, may only be changed under any of the following circumstances:

a. The teacher made a mistake in encoding the final grade;
b. The teacher made a mistake in computing the final grade;
c. The teacher is replacing the entered grade of "Incomplete" with a grade of "No Credit" or a numerical grade.

A change of grade may be initiated by the student or the teacher. However, the formal request must be made by the teacher. The format request must be made no later than the end of the following semester.
